                                                "example_id": "2858dd15-de26-46fd-84ea-025f22d61e8c",
                                                "sense_id": "6e0ffaff-fa99-31ae-a034-c7b2238ed88b",
                                                "text": "Kissing the tendril fingers - at first because Mina, its mother, did not - but later with a rapture begot by its breath on her breast."
